---
import Icon from './Icon.astro';
---
<div class="hero-product" data-hero-product data-stage="map"><div class="hero-product-window"><div class="hp-topbar"><span class="hp-app-mark"><img src="/brand/tracegate-mark.svg" alt="" width="18" height="18"/>Tracegate</span><span>Environment / Production</span><span class="hp-demo-label">DEMO</span></div><div class="hp-workspace"><div class="hp-sidebar" aria-hidden="true"><span class="hp-sidebar-selected"><Icon name="route" size={18}/></span><Icon name="cloud" size={18}/><Icon name="fingerprint" size={18}/><Icon name="database" size={18}/><span class="hp-sidebar-bottom"><Icon name="adjustments-horizontal" size={18}/></span></div><div class="hp-main"><div class="hp-view-heading"><div><span class="meta">CONNECTED ENVIRONMENT</span><h2>Every connection counts.</h2></div><span class="hp-environment-dot"></span></div><div class="hp-topology"><svg class="hp-edges" viewBox="0 0 600 330" preserveAspectRatio="none" aria-hidden="true"><g class="hp-context-edges"><path d="M65 170 180 60 300 135 420 45 535 170 M65 170 165 285 300 135 425 275 535 170 M180 60 420 45 M165 285 425 275 M180 60 165 285 M420 45 425 275"/></g><path class="hp-trace-edge hp-trace-one" d="M65 170 C160 170 190 135 300 135"/><path class="hp-trace-edge hp-trace-two" d="M300 135 C410 135 440 170 535 170"/><g class="hp-packets"><circle r="4"><animateMotion dur="3.5s" repeatCount="indefinite" path="M65 170 C160 170 190 135 300 135 C410 135 440 170 535 170"/></circle><circle r="3"><animateMotion begin="1.75s" dur="3.5s" repeatCount="indefinite" path="M65 170 C160 170 190 135 300 135 C410 135 440 170 535 170"/></circle></g><g class="hp-map-dots"><circle cx="180" cy="60" r="3"/><circle cx="420" cy="45" r="3"/><circle cx="165" cy="285" r="3"/><circle cx="425" cy="275" r="3"/></g></svg><span class="hp-context-node hp-cn-1" aria-hidden="true"><Icon name="server" size={17}/></span><span class="hp-context-node hp-cn-2" aria-hidden="true"><Icon name="cloud" size={18}/></span><span class="hp-context-node hp-cn-3" aria-hidden="true"><Icon name="code" size={17}/></span><span class="hp-context-node hp-cn-4" aria-hidden="true"><Icon name="users" size={17}/></span><button class="hp-node hp-entry" data-hero-node="0" aria-pressed="false"><span class="hp-node-symbol"><Icon name="world" size={25}/></span><span class="hp-node-kind">WORKLOAD</span><strong>web-production</strong></button><button class="hp-node hp-role" data-hero-node="1" aria-pressed="true"><span class="hp-node-symbol"><Icon name="key" size={27}/></span><span class="hp-node-kind">MACHINE IDENTITY</span><strong>deployment-role</strong></button><button class="hp-node hp-target" data-hero-node="2" aria-pressed="false"><span class="hp-node-symbol"><Icon name="database" size={25}/></span><span class="hp-node-kind">CRITICAL RESOURCE</span><strong>production-secrets</strong></button><span class="hp-boundary" aria-hidden="true"><Icon name="lock" size={14}/><span>Scope proposal</span></span><span class="hp-topology-label">SELECT A NODE TO INSPECT</span></div><div class="hp-evidence"><span class="hp-evidence-icon"><Icon name="key" size={21}/></span><div><span class="meta" data-hero-evidence-label>IDENTITY CONTEXT</span><strong data-hero-evidence-title>One role. More context.</strong><p data-hero-evidence-copy>Effective grant · Owner · Target sensitivity</p></div><span class="hp-evidence-tag" data-hero-evidence-tag>Inspect access</span></div></div></div><div class="hp-stages" role="group" aria-label="Product preview stages"><button data-hero-stage="map" aria-pressed="true"><span>01</span>Map</button><button data-hero-stage="trace" aria-pressed="false"><span>02</span>Trace</button><button data-hero-stage="review" aria-pressed="false"><span>03</span>Review</button><button class="hp-playback" data-hero-playback aria-label="Pause product preview" aria-pressed="false"><svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" aria-hidden="true"><path class="hp-pause" d="M8 5v14M16 5v14"/><path class="hp-play" d="m8 5 11 7-11 7Z"/></svg></button></div><div class="hp-progress" aria-hidden="true"><span></span></div></div><div class="hp-floating-note"><span class="hp-note-mark"><Icon name="route" size={18}/></span><div><strong data-hero-note>Connect the environment.</strong><span data-hero-note-copy>Cloud + identity + resource context</span></div></div><span class="hp-footnote">LIVE INTERACTION · SYNTHETIC ENVIRONMENT</span></div>
